# English Project Language

- Write all code comments, shell output, debug messages, error messages, CLI usage text, and documentation in English.
- Do not add new Spanish text to source files, scripts, READMEs, examples, or operational logs.
- Preserve external command names, variable names, and user-provided secrets/identifiers as-is.
- When touching existing Spanish text in files, translate the nearby edited text to English.
